§§ `A conviction or finding of guilt with no order yet (s 36(1)(b))`

-- s 36(1)(b) turns on the conviction or finding of guilt alone, so the four s 36 questions arise; the child's three
-- questions about an order made against them (ss 28, 34(3), 40) do not.
